#: scenario8:scenario8_1E71D58A_55DC_44D1_93BE_5C4E4AE92DAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 605ad92f46eac2391ba2f7942ed7b9842e51ac63bf92d23bf80af71e9e321e9b
