#: scenario8:scenario8_7AD4545B_43E2_48BB_83DC_EA12AA8AC13D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5329f2a1a95e4343f76fe56b40786bdcb1b8057323fa6a4cf4a7d5303542b245
